WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:12.810
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.580
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:22.050
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.820
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:29.490
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:36.470
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:45.350
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:56.500
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.750 --> 00:01:00.700
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:04.360
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:11.480
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:20.380
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:33.750
Giacon!

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:36.620
Giacon, come out!

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.030
Giacon, it is your turn!

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:56.620
DEMON GIACON
THE LIVING SPECTER

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:06.390
Akira! Time to wake up!

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:09.390
Hey, come on Akira!

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:10.860
Hey!

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:13.690
Akira!

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:18.530
- Aren't you awake?
- Shut up! There's still time.

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:20.760
Akira, aren't you going?

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:23.330
No, you can go to school without me!

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:25.870
What're you talking about?
Today's Sunday.

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:28.100
Sunday?

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:31.270
You said you'd take me skating before
the rink gets crowded, remember?

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:33.770
You idiot! Why didn't
you say that sooner?

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:36.850
TAHARA BUILDING
GOKAKU BANK

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:41.320
Todaiji? You really invited that bookworm?

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.720
Isn't he busy studying?

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.930
Don't worry.
He promised me yesterday.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:51.130
Not even the chairman
can resist my charms!

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:54.060
Absolutely not!

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:55.630
You don't want to become
like Papa, do you?

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.600
You don't, right? You want to get
into a good school, don't you?

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:02.070
So you'd better study hard even if
they call you a bookworm!

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:04.070
You will, of course, right?

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:07.540
You'll become a real man, Hairo.

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:09.580
Become a better man than Papa!

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.350
Huh? Did you call me?

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.190
- No!
- Thought so.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.550
- Todaiji!
- Chaco!

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:20.290
- Are you going skating?
- Y-Yes...

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:23.230
Absolutely not! Or do you want
to end up like Papa?

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:26.430
You are not to leave!

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.140
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.280
How disappointing.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:45.210
I'm sorry. I really want to go, but...

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:48.080
Hairo, the coffee is ready!

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:50.620
Yes, ma'am!
Sorry, some other time.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:52.930
Hairo!

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:07.640
Dammit, I wanted to go skating.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:10.240
Dammit! I want to go skating!

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:13.750
A purple cat!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.040
You need to focus, Chaco!

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:44.020
But...
Man, that hurts!

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:47.580
I could've sworn I saw a guy
that looked just like Hairo!

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:48.910
I was shocked!

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.050
Shocked enough that you fell?

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.550
You've literally fallen for him!

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:54.890
You're seeing Bookworm Todaiji even
when he's not around!

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:01.600
- Look! There's Todaiji!
- Huh?

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:07.970
Todaiji!

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:10.140
Hey, what's up?

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:12.800
Todaiji's here!

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:14.250
What? No way!

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:17.210
The three of us just saw him.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:21.050
Akira! Akira!

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:24.480
I can't believe it. Todaiji is here!

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.250
That makes four witnesses!

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:29.990
I guess he must've escaped.
I'm impressed!

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:32.250
Let's go find him.

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:33.260
Yeah.

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:46.300
Devilman still has yet to notice.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:49.110
Behold the sorcery of
my servant, Giacon!

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:03.790
Did you skate as much as you desired?

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:08.300
Now, I shall take what you owe me!

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:13.790
Soul of Hairo Todaiji,
dissolve into edible form!

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.070
Return to your edible form!

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:29.140
Souls are my favorite food.

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:33.950
For seven days and seven nights,
this soul will fuel my magic.

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:37.120
It'll be your turn next, Devilman.
And when that happens...

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:40.500
SKATING CENTER

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.760
That's weird. I couldn't
find him anywhere.

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:46.230
But I'm sure I saw him!

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.870
Were you just seeing things?

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:51.670
No, I'm certain I saw him!

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.070
Okay, okay.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.110
You're his girlfriend,
so you would know.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:12.190
Why not check on
your beloved Todaiji?

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:15.800
Dear me. I'm only at ease when
he's by my side.

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:17.390
You little...

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:19.340
Well, fair enough.

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.700
Yeah!

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:31.070
Hello!

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:36.180
Todaiji might be home, after all!

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.990
These are his shoes, right?

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:42.220
Hello!

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:50.900
Oh, it's just you kids.

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:53.300
Hairo is...

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:07.140
Hairo!

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:10.580
Hairo?

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:14.280
Hey, snap out of it!

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.380
Hairo! Hairo!

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:18.650
You're the only one I can count on!

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:20.820
All your father does is drink!

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:22.560
Hairo! Hairo!

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:24.660
You're the only one I can count on!

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.760
All your father does is drink!

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:28.230
Cut it out!

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:30.900
- You're the one always making him study.
- What was that?!

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:32.800
You're making him neurotic!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:35.510
- Say that again!
- I'm sorry, dear.

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:41.950
This is Giacon's fur!

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:58.130
Giacon, where are you?

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:12.480
DEVIL!

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.480
Devil Eye!

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.590
There you are, Giacon!

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:49.210
Damn! He escaped into
an interdimensional gap!

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:57.660
He's a quick one...

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:12.110
Where did Akira go?
He's so unreliable!

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:16.840
Akira, where have you been?

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:18.540
Don't just stand there!

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:21.250
Help us! We're taking
him to the hospital.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:23.180
Okay.

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:37.430
Do you think Hairo will recover?

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:39.900
I'm positive he will.

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.910
I'm glad to hear it.

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:45.930
His only hope is for
me to catch Giacon.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:48.880
Hey, isn't that Mr. Alphonne?

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:53.340
I didn't know he could drive.

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:56.380
Hey! My beloved students!

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:03.260
I'm at the wheel like
a full-fledged racer!

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.200
Look out!

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.910
Is he going to be all right?

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:35.320
We'll be at the hospital soon.
Just wait, Hairo.

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:45.300
This traffic is really holding
down Racer Alphonne!

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:50.400
Oh, how I wish I could go full speed!

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:55.840
You want to go full speed?

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:58.250
Very well. I shall grant your wish.

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:07.710
Drive, Alphonne!
Race, Alphonne!

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.960
Go as fast as you desire!

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:55.270
Hairo!

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:00.510
Mr. Alphonne!

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:05.280
How dare you hurt my precious Hairo...

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:14.250
You are angry enough to kill him, yes?

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:17.720
Very well. I shall grant your wish.

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:33.870
HOKUBU HOSPITAL

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:36.340
She wants to kill him?

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:40.410
- That's right.
- Hey, watch what you say!

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:41.940
But!

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.710
She wants to kill him?

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:48.950
Sir, where's Mr. Alphonne?

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:51.400
Asleep somewhere, apparently.

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:54.620
What kind of teacher
would wreck a student's car?

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:59.040
Shameless! I want to kill
him as much as Chaco does!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.700
WARD B

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:08.880
Chaco!

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:12.740
H-Hey!

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:15.750
Wait, Chaco.

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:21.350
Do you really want to kill Mr. Alphonne?

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:21.920
Stop this.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:27.570
Wait, Chaco!

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:32.370
I get it! She's fallen
under Giacon's spell!

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:45.810
She moved it with her mind!

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:47.940
She can use telekinesis now?

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:50.290
But, I don't know how to stop it!

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.420
Damn!

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:11.310
DEVIL!

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:17.080
Devil Wing!

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:21.480
Devil Eye!

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:28.990
You won't get away this time!

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:32.160
I've been waiting, Devilman!

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:39.260
Devil Arrow!

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:44.030
Devil Cutter!

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:54.350
Demon Giacon!

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:58.090
You've found me out, Devilman!

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:08.370
There's your true form.
Let's go!

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:17.030
Devilman, you are too late!

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:19.070
The girl has already found Alphonne!

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:20.200
What?

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:52.740
Where are you, Giacon?

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:19.740
Hey, you! You can't be in here!

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.150
Giacon, did you run away?

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:20.230
Devil Beam!

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:37.920
What the?

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:41.070
H-Hairo!

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:43.060
You're awake, Hairo!

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:46.120
Chaco, thank God!
Thank God!

00:19:46.650 --> 00:19:49.020
Oh no! I've gotta get
back to studying!

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:50.360
Where are we?

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:56.030
Akira!

00:19:58.430 --> 00:20:01.160
Where have you been?

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:03.760
They're both awake!

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:05.740
I know. Don't rush me.

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:09.580
Heh! Akira sure does play it cool.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:16.780
Giacon, you fought well.

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:19.580
Die at ease.

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:21.750
The time for Devilman's defeat has come!

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:23.920
But, who will defeat him?

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:28.490
It bears not asking! By myself, Muxan,
the invincible Evil General!

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:49.840
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:56.580
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.420 --> 00:21:04.230
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:10.080
Who Devilman really is

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:14.000
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:17.200
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.200
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:33.090
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:53.120
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:59.320
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:04.810
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:11.920
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:16.700
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:19.700
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.700 --> 00:22:26.380
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:36.520
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:22:58.970 --> 00:23:00.780
Grand Demon Lord Xenon!

00:23:01.310 --> 00:23:05.050
Please behold my work
from the netherworld!

00:23:05.510 --> 00:23:07.510
With my needle and thread,

00:23:08.080 --> 00:23:14.320
I shall ensnare the human
world with my spell!

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:34.380
Evil General Muxan's magic seals
the academy in a pocket dimension.

00:23:43.820 --> 00:23:44.990
It's the end of the world!

00:23:48.390 --> 00:23:49.990
Help me!

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:51.990
No! Pervert!

00:23:54.590 --> 00:23:55.730
Chaco!

00:24:03.670 --> 00:24:12.210
Damn!

00:24:12.210 --> 00:24:14.910
The dimensional monster attack the school!

00:24:14.920 --> 00:24:20.190
Evil General Muxan's evil clutches
attack the teachers and the students.

00:24:28.030 --> 00:24:32.240
Can Devilman break
through Muxan's magic?

00:24:44.580 --> 00:24:45.740
Next time on Devilman:

00:24:45.750 --> 00:24:49.750
EVIL GENERAL MUXAN
THE GREAT SCHOOL ASSAULT
